@startuml
title Flow 1 - Admin Creates and Configures a Tournament

|Admin|
start
:Log in as Admin;
:Create a new tournament;

|System|
:Create tournament with DRAFT status;

|Admin|
:Enter basic tournament information;
note right
Name, description, venue,
registration period,
competition period
end note
:Configure entry fee,
min/max participants,
and check-in deadline;
:Configure rounds and races;
note right
Qualifier, semifinal,
final, and race count per round
end note
:Configure advancement rules
and prizes;

|System|
:Validate tournament configuration;
if (Is configuration valid?) then (No)
  :Return missing/invalid data errors;

  |Admin|
  :Update tournament configuration;

  |System|
  :Validate configuration again;
else (Yes)
endif

if (Is configuration valid?) then (Yes)
  |Admin|
  :Publish / Open registration;

  |System|
  :Move tournament
DRAFT -> OPEN_REGISTRATION;
  :Send tournament registration
opening notification;
  stop
else (No)
  |System|
  :Keep tournament in DRAFT;
  stop
endif
@enduml

@startuml
title Flow 2 - Owner Invites Jockey and Registers for Tournament

|Owner|
start
:View tournaments with
OPEN_REGISTRATION status;
:Select an approved horse;
:Select an eligible Jockey;
:Send Jockey invitation;

|System|
:Validate Owner, Horse, Jockey,
Tournament/Race, and schedule conflicts;
if (Is invitation valid?) then (No)
  :Return error to Owner;

  |Owner|
  :Choose another horse/Jockey
or update invitation details;
  stop
else (Yes)
  :Create invitation with PENDING status;
  :Send notification to Jockey;
endif

|Jockey|
:View invitation details;
if (Does Jockey accept?) then (No)
  :Reject invitation;

  |System|
  :Update invitation = REJECTED;
  :Notify Owner;

  |Owner|
  :Receive rejection result;
  stop
else (Yes)
  :Accept invitation;

  |System|
  :Revalidate eligibility;
  if (Are Jockey/Horse still eligible?) then (No)
    :Return error to Jockey;
    :Keep invitation in PENDING status;
    stop
  else (Yes)
    :Update invitation = ACCEPTED;
    :Notify Owner;
  endif
endif

|Owner|
:Submit tournament/race registration
with horse + accepted jockey;

|System|
:Check tournament status,
capacity limits,
wallet/fee, and duplicate registration;
if (Is registration valid?) then (No)
  :Return error to Owner;

  |Owner|
  :Update registration details;
  stop
else (Yes)
  :Create registration = PENDING;
  :Process entry fee;
  :Notify Admin about new registration;
endif

|Admin|
:Review PENDING registration;
if (Does Admin approve?) then (Yes)
  :Approve registration;

  |System|
  :Update registration = APPROVED;
  :Create race participant;
  :Notify Owner/Jockey;
  stop
else (No)
  :Reject registration;

  |System|
  :Update registration = REJECTED;
  :Refund fee if applicable;
  :Notify Owner/Jockey;
  stop
endif
@enduml

@startuml
title Flow 3 - Admin Assigns Referee and Records Race Results

|Admin|
start
:Close registration or select
APPROVED registrations;

|System|
:Check minimum participant requirement;
if (Is scheduling allowed?) then (No)
  :Return insufficient participant error;

  |Admin|
  :Wait for more registrations
or adjust configuration;
  stop
else (Yes)
endif

|Admin|
:Generate / arrange races and heats
based on round configuration;
:Assign gate numbers to participants;
:Assign Referee to each race;

|System|
:Check Referee schedule conflicts;
if (Does Referee have conflict?) then (Yes)
  :Return error so Admin can reassign;

  |Admin|
  :Select another Referee;
  stop
else (No)
  :Update race = SCHEDULED;
  :Send notification to Referee;
endif

|Referee|
:On race day;
:Open check-in;
:Check in participants;
note right
PASSED, ABSENT,
DISQUALIFIED, or FAILED
end note

|System|
:Check race start conditions;
if (Can race start?) then (No)
  :Report race is not ready;

  |Referee|
  :Update check-in or report issue;
  stop
else (Yes)
endif

|Referee|
:Start race;
:Record violations if any;
:Enter draft result;
note right
Rank, finish time,
and notes
end note
:Submit report;

|System|
:Update race = PENDING_RESULT;

|Admin|
:Review draft result and report;
if (Does Admin request changes?) then (Yes)
  :Send change request to Referee;

  |Referee|
  :Update draft result/report;

  |System|
  :Keep race = PENDING_RESULT;
  stop
else (No, approve)
  :Approve result;

  |System|
  :Update race =
RESULT_CONFIRMED or COMPLETED;
  :Update leaderboard;
  :Process advancement to next round
or final ranking;
  :Notify related users about result;
  stop
endif
@enduml
